{"id":"n30211-1-13","stage":1,"title":"화장실 · 洗手间","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30211-1-13-1","ko":"세 시간 이상 차를 타야 하니까 미리 화장실에 다녀오자.","zh":"因为要坐车三个小时以上，我们先去趟洗手间吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}},{"text":"시간","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}},{"text":"이상","meaning":"以上","explanation":"이상：以上","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"1","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}},{"text":"차를","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차를","audio":"/audio/c9101b9a3fcbc9e75de1.mp3"}},{"text":"타야","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타야","audio":"/audio/37207ef76f0932d325f8.mp3"}},{"text":"하니까","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origi